      "kind": "theorem",
      "type": "∀ {R : Type u_1} {S : Type u_2} [inst : CommRing R] [Nontrivial R] [inst_2 : CommRing S] [inst_3 : LinearOrder S]\n  [IsStrictOrderedRing S] {n : Type u_3} [inst_5 : Fintype n] [inst_6 : DecidableEq n] {A : Matrix n n R}\n  {abv : AbsoluteValue R S} {x : S},\n  (∀ (i j : n), abv (A i j) ≤ x) → abv A.det ≤ (Fintype.card n).factorial • x ^ Fintype.card n"
